Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: libegl1, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kvantos/blossom
Description: Org mode notes, tasks and agenda
 Blossom is a desktop app for a folder of org mode files. It reads and edits
 them in place, so Emacs, git and Syncthing keep working on the same files.
 It comes with blsm, a command-line tool for search, agenda and capture.
